{"title":"Silverhide Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 48) · Monster drop: Selene, Mother Of Moths, Young Red Dragon, Ogre Charger, Warchief Ruk Gorehand</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 48 <span class=\"muted\">(2602 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/silver-hide\">Silver Hide</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moon-mother\" title=\"Selene, Mother Of Moths - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7c86cf4529db3a6a02f0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Selene, Mother Of Moths</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 1 of 129 looted corpses (1/129)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/129<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 1 of 516 looted corpses (1/516)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/516<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 2,106 looted corpses (1/2,106)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2,106<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silverhide-arms\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-hide\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Hide</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/74ad12c317066662bc3e.svg\" alt=\"Silverhide Arms\"></div><h3>Silverhide Arms</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Leatherworking 48</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/28/2026, 9:00:31 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}